#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/institutions/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Institutions"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/institutions/CONTEXT.md
msgid "The institutions that provide education, the sites they operate from, and the state of those sites."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/institutions/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/institutions/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Institution**: An organisation registered to provide education, such as a school or college, identified independently of where it operates. _Avoid_: School (as the generic term), centre, establishment"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/institutions/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Site**: A physical location where education takes place, with its buildings and services. _Avoid_: Campus, premises, address"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/institutions/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Occupancy**: The effective-dated link between an institution and a site it operates from; an institution may occupy several sites and a site may host several institutions. _Avoid_: Location assignment"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/institutions/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Facility status**: The recorded condition and availability of a service at a site, such as water, power or connectivity, as at a date. _Avoid_: Infrastructure flag"
msgstr ""
